                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg426">p. 426</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d437-f2" n="2" xml:id="d437-f2-content">
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg971">p. 971</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d437-f3" n="3" xml:id="d437-f3-content">
                <p>This draft of subparagraph 8(<hi rendition="#italic">i</hi>) was approved by the
                    Combined Chiefs of Staff at their 114th Meeting, August 21, 1943. See <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg921">p. 921</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
